  "text_md": "(2)\n![](<2503.09088_pg2_images/imageFile4.png>)\na = 12 θ2 − 31 λ, b = 21 θ2 − 13 (1 − λ), c = 12(1 − θ2)µ, d = 12(1 − θ2)(1 − µ),\nα =\n![](<2503.09088_pg2_images/imageFile12.png>)\n![](<2503.09088_pg2_images/imageFile6.png>)\n![](<2503.09088_pg2_images/imageFile9.png>)\nAl2 h30 ≈ 1,\n![](<2503.09088_pg2_images/imageFile5.png>)\n![](<2503.09088_pg2_images/imageFile1.png>)\n2\n=\nh0 l2 ≪ 1, S =\nA h0 ≪ 1, β =\n# 2 Model Derivation\n![](<2503.09088_pg2_images/imageFile2.png>)\n(4)",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "block_type": "text",
