      "text": "From 2002 to 2004, Bona, Chen and Saut [6, 7] started from the free - surface Euler equations. Following the derivation context of the Boussinesq original equations, they considered the equivalent relationships among the physical quantities in the shallow water region and combined the following expanded physical perturbation parameters",
